    "agendaChanges": "Dennis McBride requested adding a staff recognition item, which was placed after item 5 (Oral Communication). There were no speaker cards for item 5 (Oral Communication) so that item was effectively skipped over. The meeting proceeded through Section 6 action items after the staff recognition. An additional item (Section 8.1, COVID-19/at-home learning update) was addressed after the bond action items, though it does not appear in the formal agenda as posted — the meeting substantially addressed a discussion/update item 8.1 referenced repeatedly in the transcript. The formal agenda as posted only lists Sections 1–7 for this emergency meeting, but the transcript covers additional items including bond consent items, bond action items (7.1), and an extended COVID-19 discussion (8.1) and reports (11.1) that reflect a fuller agenda than the posted emergency agenda.",
